                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            White.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-12-26"><hi rendition="#italic">December 26,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay directs Mr. White to inquire of Lord Lansdowne, in view of Venezuela’s
                    acceptance in principle of arbitration by The Hague tribunal, if Mr. Hay is at
                    liberty to communicate the propositions to the Government of Venezuela.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
